These files are vendored for reference and optional hosts.
Default host binary does not compile the ObjC TUs.
`-DMVLLM_OFFICIAL_METAL_HOST=ON` builds them.
h3_gpu.m has small SDK-14 guards (MTLMathModeSafe / MPSGraph SDPA
need macOS 15); those paths return nil on older SDKs.
`-DMVLLM_VENDOR_METAL=ON` compile-tests the .metal files at init.

These files are vendored for reference and future device ports.
They are not compiled into the default host binary.
